     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Numeric codes for categories are still categories.  If the *class* is numeric, then the variable(s) will be treated as continuous unless you declare them as ordered using that argument.</div><div><br></div><div><div><div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics</div><div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792423385255000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QJGniy8lIeArnHXTpe-N4\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
